      "Directed features only.",
      "The filmography's director table also holds an unfinished first attempt and four shorts, and none of them are here: Number 13 was abandoned mid-shoot and is lost, and An Elastic Affair, The Fighting Generation, Bon Voyage and Aventure Malgache are shorts, not features. Everything from The Pleasure Garden through Family Plot is."
